; c_e3_knife: Malrik's camp table on the ridge. A trestle top, two legs, the map of the south camp (parchment, Lark
; Hill's crest and the four wagon spots inked on it) and a short candle. Origin = the ground under the table's centre.
; The four wooden tokens are a separate scene (war_tokens.tscn) so the film can hide them when Hush takes them.

